~ start
{{habitant.name}}: [[Hi|Hello]], I was just thinking of you.
{{habitant.name}}: I think of you as a friend.
%2 {{habitant.name}}: Friends are important to me
%2 => own_friend_talk
%1 => ask_player
=> END

~ own_friend_talk
if friend!=null:
	{{habitant.name}}: I have other friends too though..
	if friend_affiliation.happiness_A >1.2:
		{{habitant.name}}: {{friend.name}} is one of my best friends ever!
	elif friend_affiliation.happiness_A >0.5:
		{{habitant.name}}: I like {{friend.name}}. I value that friendship.
	else:
		{{habitant.name}}: {{friend.name}}... but they didn't have much time for me lately.
		{{habitant.name}}: Maybe I should pause that friendship for a while.
if friend==null:
	{{habitant.name}}: I don't have any other friends right now.
	{{habitant.name}}: But there are more urgent matters in my life right now.
=> END

~ ask_player
{{habitant.name}}: Do you have many friends?
- Yes!
	{{habitant.name}}: That's nice, everyone should have friends.
- No
	{{habitant.name}}: That's not true, at least you have me.
=> END